From: Nathan Sanchez <nathanasanchez@google.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 16:07:02 -0500
Subject: [M157][Ganesh] Ensure flush token is advanced at the end of every
 flush

Ensure the token tracker moves forward once per flush, even if no draws
were executed, so per-flush token comparisons in GrDrawOpAtlas stay
accurate across flushes.

Fixed: 581212089
Bug: 581212089,576944655
Change-Id: I4983f9cca45be1657557b680d5fdda51045266e8
Reviewed-on: https://skia-review.googlesource.com/c/skia/+/1410039
Reviewed-by: Michael Ludwig <michaelludwig@google.com>
Commit-Queue: Nathan Sanchez <nathanasanchez@google.com>
(cherry picked from commit 7c733dd2a0bd5673dfd643d4c02b3d5738a7be3d)
Reviewed-on: https://skia-review.googlesource.com/c/skia/+/1415636
Commit-Queue: Thomas Smith <thomsmit@google.com>
Auto-Submit: Nathan Sanchez <nathanasanchez@google.com>
Reviewed-by: Thomas Smith <thomsmit@google.com>

diff --git a/src/gpu/Token.h b/src/gpu/Token.h
index 1c5319eeec4ccd63f96dd6dde977c11468756e59..be476647f2430dab5097643cc782867511cf1789 100644
--- a/src/gpu/Token.h
+++ b/src/gpu/Token.h
@@ -92,6 +92,7 @@ private:
 
     Token issueDrawToken() { return ++fCurrentDrawToken; }
     Token issueFlushToken() { return ++fCurrentFlushToken; }
+    void catchUpFlushToken() { fCurrentFlushToken = fCurrentDrawToken; }
 
     Token fCurrentDrawToken = Token::InvalidToken();
     Token fCurrentFlushToken = Token::InvalidToken();
diff --git a/src/gpu/ganesh/GrOpFlushState.cpp b/src/gpu/ganesh/GrOpFlushState.cpp
index 9b20ac81b7fd048564b354ad361ac5dec144ff87..abec1d14c65afb9c6ed4a14b77785734d44ce4ee 100644
--- a/src/gpu/ganesh/GrOpFlushState.cpp
+++ b/src/gpu/ganesh/GrOpFlushState.cpp
@@ -127,6 +127,12 @@ void GrOpFlushState::reset() {
     fDraws.reset();
     fBaseDrawToken = skgpu::Token::InvalidToken();
     fDeferredUploadFailed = false;
+    // Advance the tokens at the end of every flush, even one that executed no draws, so that work
+    // scheduled during this flush is never considered pending by a later flush.
+    if (fTokenTracker) {
+        fTokenTracker->issueDrawToken();
+        fTokenTracker->catchUpFlushToken();
+    }
 }
 
 bool GrOpFlushState::doUpload(GrDeferredTextureUploadFn& upload,
